## 🛡️ 3. Resilience & Graceful Degradation

If the MongoDB cluster goes offline or a fetch fails:
- **`loading.tsx`**: A custom-themed spinner immediately renders while the server resolves the fetch payload.
- **`error.tsx`**: A branded error boundary catches the exception and provides a "Catalog Offline" message with a manual Retry button, preventing the dreaded Next.js blank screen of death.

